{"type":"message","id":"203103ee","parentId":"fc340e93","timestamp":"2026-03-18T14:04:54.171Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Explaining tool limitations**\n\nI need to clarify that the tool only returns JSON data, which complicates things a bit because I can't or shouldn't send an absolute path. It's important to communicate this limitation clearly. However, if the user requests it, I can definitely send an image back instead. I want to ensure that the user understands what I can and can't do with the tool to help them better.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0eb31b7df48e8eaa0169bab100215c819185f0e9816c2b1625\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpurEDNjDuY3vcBHtUF0tJQ8I_rUnRpDCtOaTblrwvuG7D54fK6GzCTwL5cOevdHCVW-c1ybdHjTZMerJiX7N7dG8kXP17v_WxE4CedDIpf3zDV47rFzGt6OP1poWB6GjsRlhEFLsI4yc2Vhbg-9ARZc7VHDRAsl3FuRdRhBORNn7PoNZGoweI--EGadFSZF_uAdrqSdZ8GAV5GZBlpKeakQ0K9gsd_O01WdUcrVnuh_C8dj3HHC-ELHoCSvrPasQrMX2t08WaicMPvbnE4LpsUdyk8Gu6dsKYa2PoBywcrMr12WHdHluoqzCuyKa7_rzU2sH-WVxKKqwaQz_lRrPzTlwrlwWrp1Dyvx5ZphlHnlRzGNO9cwUG0TUZ3AjvrnjNnc6EeeafHXBxtWuCEVCtI_KmspyAmxnG-4ACCNLNGMC7Lzg59NMyxoOa8CgX5SQX3JT8NN-M7xu85bfDh14MqOD4WQOaHv-aDkbH7VmbbnC8BnbZuJX44QtEOeDZQ8tOkmWaAjzXPzYX2wdgTiUnrM5flayIu8i95K2iRY7bCz0U1DFU0EOLTAfXjeRafHnimVH8fdCq-Jb5yQlV9xnFoFz_d0wqmttPwdAwnLlJOtHzv8q6KUFIx6XJ5xcCdGbG7JeBXuWyvjW9f33VwE34gNJxCofiGGsRqJVJCQYz_jLaXtYXPlZ_KU402r-RLuzhGaY4VO1_6yZeM0DrrncfuIOGM1jubw-25Ln83rDKWxO7dkG4ruUU82zk9RGdITc7CRL1kz9nHuZHX92y2K4hePHBwHwDdeXzZ0r-M4eyGD_ASUjhvXWJslqvF0LNuTPylsI33ETUU4XwuwDLfJk-o2m2F2pq5A4FR4YCpPzOkEUOMLLIrtshi-A5sbrvCc2hLRdBL4nCp-qmqhkL0kHyc2UZXMXzZJrF1GBO2RkdwqhaG0fUUx--igxMqVYpxcOp2Th6HK15BRUo_Rfwr5eb5nnZ6gk3dGpw3-LYhPChaS054VmCUaAO8a7YKR5b-NEmXDAR\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Explaining tool limitations**\\n\\nI need to clarify that the tool only returns JSON data, which complicates things a bit because I can't or shouldn't send an absolute path. It's important to communicate this limitation clearly. However, if the user requests it, I can definitely send an image back instead. I want to ensure that the user understands what I can and can't do with the tool to help them better.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I didn’t send the image back because the kidney-detection pipeline returned only the **analysis result**, not a generated output image, and your request was to **perform detection** rather than to echo the uploaded CT image.\n\nAlso, attached media has to be sent back explicitly as a separate media response — it doesn’t happen automatically just because a `file_path` exists. If you want, I can send the same image back or help annotate/explain what was analyzed.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0eb31b7df48e8eaa0169bab103862081919812a653300e7568\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8455,"output":137,"cacheRead":3584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12176,"cost":{"input":0.0211375,"output":0.002055,"cacheRead":0.000896,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024088500000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773842685182}}
